*************************************
***      BUILD WITH CMAKE        ****
*************************************
- Move to build directory
  cd build
- Build the plugin
  cmake ..
  make
*************************************
***       BUILD WITH GCC         ****
*************************************
- Make sure you have g++ and the
  required curl dependency, then
  run the following:

  g++ -std=c++11 main.cpp \
     -o check_almond_ps -lcurl

